    "title_en": "Performance and quality testing of CBM RICH front-end electronics",
    "abstract_en": "This note describes the laboratory setup at the University of Wuppertal and its use to measure charge sharing crosstalk, perform high rate and high occupancy tests of MAPMT-DIRICH readout elec- tronics using a realistic detector setup, and also includes the analysis of induced electronic noise characteristics of a new iteration of the DIRICH power module to be used in the CBM RICH readout chain.",
